/* ConsentimentRestauracio i VistaConsentiment: la pantalla del permís i retirar-lo */
"Mentrestant, «%@» ha canviat: torna-ho a provar." = "In the meantime, “%@” changed: try again.";
"Un cop al dia, l'app mira a GitHub si hi ha una versió nova i s'hi actualitza sola. Ho pots apagar a la Configuració." = "Once a day, the app checks GitHub for a new version and updates itself. You can turn this off in Settings.";
"Warp Launch ha deixat l'ajust de Warp com t'ha dit en confirmar-ho, i ja no té permís per tocar-lo. Si la tornes a obrir, te'l tornarà a demanar." = "Warp Launch has left Warp's setting as it said when you confirmed, and no longer has permission to change it. If you open it again, it will ask for permission again.";
"Sense aquest permís, Warp Launch no es pot fer servir. Si surts, no es desa res, i t'ho tornarà a preguntar la propera vegada." = "Without this permission, Warp Launch can't be used. If you quit, nothing is saved, and it will ask you again next time.";
"%@. Mentre no l'arreglis o l'esborris, Warp Launch no es pot fer servir." = "%@. Until you fix or delete it, Warp Launch can't be used.";
"%@. Mentre no l'arreglis o l'esborris (%@), Warp Launch no es pot fer servir." = "%@. Until you fix or delete it (%@), Warp Launch can't be used.";
"Sense carpeta de configuració, Warp Launch no ha tocat Warp." = "Without a configuration folder, Warp Launch hasn't touched Warp.";
"Ja has deixat de fer servir Warp Launch." = "You've already stopped using Warp Launch.";
"Sense el teu permís, Warp Launch no ha tocat Warp." = "Without your permission, Warp Launch hasn't touched Warp.";
"Amb una configuració de prova (--config), Warp Launch no toca l'ajust de Warp: no hi ha res per tornar com era. Només es pot fer amb la configuració de debò." = "With a test configuration (--config), Warp Launch doesn't touch Warp's setting: there's nothing to put back. It can only be done with the real configuration.";
"«%@» ja no diu que hi hagi el teu permís: torna a obrir Warp Launch." = "“%@” no longer says you gave permission: open Warp Launch again.";
"No s'ha pogut tornar l'ajust de Warp com era: %@. L'ajust i el permís no han canviat." = "Couldn't put Warp's setting back the way it was: %@. The setting and the permission haven't changed.";
"No s'ha pogut retirar el permís: %@. L'ajust de Warp torna a quedar desactivat, i el permís no ha canviat." = "Couldn't withdraw the permission: %@. Warp's setting is turned off again, and the permission hasn't changed.";
"No s'ha pogut retirar el permís: %@. L'ajust de Warp ha quedat activat, com ve de sèrie (Warp no té «settings.toml»): Warp Launch el desactivarà quan Warp sigui obert amb alguna pestanya. El permís no ha canviat." = "Couldn't withdraw the permission: %@. Warp's setting was left on, as it comes by default (Warp has no “settings.toml”): Warp Launch will turn it off when Warp is open with a tab. The permission hasn't changed.";
"No s'ha pogut retirar el permís: %@. L'ajust de Warp ha quedat activat, i no s'ha pogut tornar a desactivar: Warp Launch ho tornarà a provar d'aquí a un minut. El permís no ha canviat." = "Couldn't withdraw the permission: %@. Warp's setting was left on and couldn't be turned off again: Warp Launch will try again in a minute. The permission hasn't changed.";
"Has deixat de fer servir Warp Launch" = "You've Stopped Using Warp Launch";
"Warp Launch ha de desactivar un ajust de Warp" = "Warp Launch Needs to Turn Off a Warp Setting";
"Abans de començar, necessita el teu permís." = "Before it starts, it needs your permission.";
"Per què cal" = "Why It's Needed";
"Quan Warp arrenca, pot tornar a obrir les pestanyes de l'última vegada, però sense Claude. Warp Launch no les reconeixeria com a seves i, en obrir les teves finestres, les pestanyes quedarien repetides." = "When Warp starts, it can reopen the tabs from last time, but without Claude. Warp Launch wouldn't recognize them as its own and, when it opens your windows, the tabs would be duplicated.";
"Què canvia" = "What Changes";
"A Warp, l'ajust «Restore windows, tabs, and panes on startup» queda desactivat (Warp Launch el desa al fitxer d'ajustos de Warp, encara que no l'hagis canviat mai). Si tens Settings Sync, també als teus altres Macs." = "In Warp, the “Restore windows, tabs, and panes on startup” setting is turned off (Warp Launch saves it in Warp's settings file, even if you've never changed it). If you have Settings Sync, on your other Macs too.";
"Només quan li demanes que llegeixi les finestres de Warp (per exemple, en importar-les), Warp Launch l'activa uns segons perquè Warp les desi, i el torna a desactivar." = "Only when you ask it to read Warp's windows (for example, when importing them) does Warp Launch turn it on for a few seconds so that Warp saves them, and then turn it off again.";
"Configuració de prova (%@): l'app no tocarà aquest ajust." = "Test configuration (%@): the app won't touch this setting.";
"No s'ha pogut desar el permís: %@." = "Couldn't save the permission: %@.";
"Accepta" = "Accept";

/* Desinstallacio: «Restaura Warp i surt…» i la seva confirmació */
"Warp Launch ja no s'obre en iniciar sessió: si vols, torna a activar l'interruptor de dalt." = "Warp Launch no longer opens at login. To turn it back on, use the switch above.";
"L'ajust de Warp %@ tornarà a estar activat, com el tenies abans de Warp Launch." = "Warp's %@ setting will be turned on again, as you had it before Warp Launch.";
"L'ajust de Warp %@ es quedarà desactivat, com el tenies abans de Warp Launch." = "Warp's %@ setting will stay off, as you had it before Warp Launch.";
"No se sap com tenies l'ajust de Warp %@ abans de Warp Launch, perquè ja la feies servir abans que demanés permís: quedarà activat, com ve de sèrie a Warp." = "It isn't known how you had Warp's %@ setting before Warp Launch, because you were already using it before it asked for permission: it will be turned on, as Warp comes by default.";
"Warp Launch no ha canviat mai l'ajust de Warp %@: es queda com és." = "Warp Launch has never changed Warp's %@ setting: it stays as it is.";
"Torna l'ajust de Warp com era, retira el permís de Warp Launch, la treu dels ítems d'inici de sessió si hi és, i surt. La configuració no s'esborra. Per desinstal·lar-la del tot, després arrossega-la a la Paperera." = "Puts Warp's setting back the way it was, withdraws Warp Launch's permission, removes it from your login items if it's there, and quits. The configuration isn't deleted. To uninstall it completely, then drag it to the Trash.";
"Vols deixar de fer servir Warp Launch?" = "Stop using Warp Launch?";
"En arrencar, Warp tornarà a obrir les pestanyes de l'última vegada, sense Claude. Si tens Settings Sync, l'ajust també canviarà als teus altres Macs." = "When it starts, Warp will reopen the tabs from last time, without Claude. If you have Settings Sync, the setting will also change on your other Macs.";
"Warp Launch deixarà de tenir permís per tocar l'ajust, sortirà dels ítems d'inici de sessió i es tancarà. La configuració no s'esborra. Si la tornes a obrir, et tornarà a demanar permís." = "Warp Launch will no longer have permission to change the setting, will be removed from your login items, and will quit. The configuration isn't deleted. If you open it again, it will ask you for permission again.";
"Warp Launch deixarà de tenir permís per tocar l'ajust i es tancarà. La configuració no s'esborra. Si la tornes a obrir, et tornarà a demanar permís." = "Warp Launch will no longer have permission to change the setting, and will quit. The configuration isn't deleted. If you open it again, it will ask you for permission again.";

/* RefrescWarp: per què no es pot tocar l'ajust de Warp, i les notes i els avisos del menú de la icona */
"«settings.toml» de Warp acaba de canviar (torna-ho a provar d'aquí a uns segons)" = "Warp's “settings.toml” has just changed (try again in a few seconds)";
"Warp no té «settings.toml», i Warp Launch només el crea amb Warp obert i amb alguna pestanya, perquè Warp hi pugui passar abans els seus ajustos antics (obre Warp i torna-ho a provar)" = "Warp has no “settings.toml”, and Warp Launch only creates it with Warp open and with a tab, so that Warp can first move its old settings into it (open Warp and try again)";
"Warp encara no té fitxer d'ajustos. Quan Warp sigui obert amb alguna pestanya, Warp Launch hi desactivarà la restauració de sessió en menys d'un minut." = "Warp doesn't have a settings file yet. When Warp is open with a tab, Warp Launch will turn off its session restore in less than a minute.";
"Warp encara no s'ha obert mai en aquest usuari: no té la seva carpeta d'ajustos, ni cap finestra per restaurar. Quan Warp la creï i sigui obert amb alguna pestanya, Warp Launch en desactivarà la restauració de sessió en menys d'un minut." = "Warp has never been opened for this user: it has no settings folder and no windows to restore. When Warp creates the folder and is open with a tab, Warp Launch will turn off its session restore in less than a minute.";
"El fitxer d'ajustos de Warp no para de canviar, i Warp Launch no hi pot desactivar la restauració de sessió. Ho continua provant cada minut." = "Warp's settings file keeps changing, and Warp Launch can't turn off session restore in it. It keeps trying every minute.";
"No es pot mirar la restauració de sessió de Warp: %@" = "Can't check Warp's session restore: %@";
"No es pot activar la restauració de sessió de Warp: %@" = "Can't turn on Warp's session restore: %@";
"No s'ha pogut desactivar la restauració de sessió de Warp: %@. Si Warp es tanca, restaurarà les finestres sense Claude." = "Couldn't turn off Warp's session restore: %@. If Warp quits, it will restore the windows without Claude.";

